  "description": {
   "en": "**A quiet and demure look at what happened before GRAND ORDER!**\n\nRomani Archaman, better known as Dr. Roman, heads the Chaldea Security Organization and as the group's chief medical officer he is tasked to watch over a young lady named Mash Kyrielight. His approach is a much more gentler and thoughtful one, full of books and relationships. Much like that relationship, this scrapbook is a collection of tales from the world of Fate/Grand Order as it has never been seen before.\n\n(Source: DENPA)"
  },
